<title>UK: Regal Hotel 96 profit soars after buys.</title>
<headline>Regal Hotel 96 profit soars after buys.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.68		   vs 3.39</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.675		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 1.0		    vs 0.5</p>
<p> Pretax		    10.43		   vs 2.91</p>
<p> Turnover		   66.3		   vs 18.1</p>
<p>Full company name - Regal Hotel Group Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE - The number of hotels owned by Regal almost quadrupled in the first half of the year when it acquired 60 UK properties from Granada Group Plc for 122 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
